            <path d="M19.4,15A7,7 0 0,0 20,12A7,7 0 0,0 19.4,9L21,7.5 18.5,3.5 16.5,4.5A7,7 0 0,0 14,3.7L13.5,2H10.5L10,3.7A7,7 0 0,0 7.5,4.5L5.5,3.5 3,7.5 4.6,9A7,7 0 0,0 4,12A7,7 0 0,0 4.6,15L3,16.5 5.5,20.5 7.5,19.5A7,7 0 0,0 10,20.3L10.5,22H13.5L14,20.3A7,7 0 0,0 16.5,19.5L18.5,20.5 21,16.5Z"/>
          </svg>Quản Trị
